explore 全部性质
  jump 序章
  rolls low, high, 0.25
  talk 村长
    - 我去。
  depth 30
  always 好感 <= 10
  eventually 猎狼.completed
  softlock 猎狼, 好感 >= 3 and chapter == 第二章, 墨梅册.第一页

test 测试里也能强制抽取
  rolls high
  expect not chance(30%)
